<k;i++)s+=a[i];\nint best=s;\nfor(int i=k;i<a.length;i++){\n    s+=a[i]-a[i-k];\n    best=Math.max(best,s);\n}\nSystem.out.println(best);"],["heading","OUTPUT AND ANALYSIS"],["text","9; O(n) time, O(1) space; assumes 1 <= k <= length."],["heading","INTERVIEW QUESTION"],["heading","How does a sliding window reduce work?"],["text","It reuses the previous window result rather than recalculating every item."],["heading","PRACTICE YOURSELF"],["text","Find max sum of length 2 in [4,1,7,2]."]]